<title>USA: Urbandale CSD, Iowa $4.9 mln won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Urbandale CSD, Iowa $4.9 mln won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Saving Bank said it won $4.9 million of Urbandale Community Sch Dist, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
</text>
